  "title": "Pistachio-Crusted Rack of Lamb",
  "description": "Serve Chef John&#39;s pistachio-crusted rack of lamb for special occasions. Sweet pistachios, spicy Dijon, and crunchy bread crumbs add nice taste and texture.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
